{"slug":"Between_Two_Seas","title":"Between Two Seas","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"Technical","text":"Technical","level":2}],"html":"<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/Black_Sea\" title=\"Black Sea\">Black Sea</a>.</div>\n<p>Map of the mountainous region between and around the Caspian sea and the Black Sea.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Between_Two_Seas_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"382\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"1778\" data-file-height=\"1062\"><figcaption>The Between Two Seas map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/betweentwoseas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 15 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Bulgaria, Republic of Turkiye, Romania, Moldova, Ukraine and Russian Federation.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Europe, Asia</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 15</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 5</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Technical\">Technical</h2></div>\n<p>The size of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is 1778 x 1062.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>","section":"Maps"}
